title: "From SMS to the operator panel: hunting a live fake-casino smishing campaign"
message: "If you use this research, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: report
authors:
  - family-names: Moraga
    given-names: Patricio
  - family-names: de la Paz
    given-names: Anthony
abstract: >-
  Threat intelligence case study of a Spanish-language smishing campaign that
  uses a fake online casino and a live operator chat, rather than a cloned
  bank. The public edition withholds infrastructure identifiers because the
  campaign was still active. Presented at 8.8 Unreal Chile.
keywords:
  - threat-intelligence
  - smishing
  - fraud
  - fake-casino
  - chile
